=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G0AGe1UsdkgQ7kNvwEutFHB&_nc_oc=AdkRG7qNsWEWzd6dkgswOW368dHEpuILfS-suU6oqJEXjvhVQdzrNHAwNVJrhD2GiSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfvPwBp7RjHdoL0ElwELy0zWX99g1hObkoFJtrJjL1xczw&oe=69A82921"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "video_thumbnail.png", "id": "173254806638033", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12482378_173254809971366_288475322431569920_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b1oP7Q6aMTwQ7kNvwG_lL3v&_nc_oc=AdnmXCqasKKdJaq8Ej-RsJImgtyzlpmex5DatUa9cdnGac0bdfu2ldY2OKgGbDFW9_k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuaVwp6B69o-1emT1PVbol64H5QTUcwKgsb9824rvM0sA&oe=69A80A99"}, "display_name": "LensPass", "keywords": ["WeLens", "LensPass", "Video", "Cinema", "Sync"], "long_description": "Use LensPass to watch and share 360-degree videos, with support for 3D formats and spatial audio. Pair LensPass with the accompanying LensPass Android app for more capabilities including: \n\n* Monitor and control VR viewings on any number of headsets over WiFi. Sync headsets and get real-time device battery and temperature levels.\n\n* Use Theater Mode for streamlined viewings where all viewer controls are disabled.  You can customize your screening setup with a short countdown sequence and other options to fit the needs of your VR screening.\n\n* Add your own logo and message through the LensPass Screening Dashboard.\n\n* After your VR screenings, view auto-generated analytics reports that show include the viewing completion rates and other information", "short_description": "Use LensPass to watch and share 360-degree videos, and pair it with the accompanying LensPass Android app for more customization and control features that are designed to help share VR experiences."}]}, "developer_name": "WeLens, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.welens.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.welens.com/terms", "publi